## Proposed Changes

### Database & Site Config

#### [MODIFY] [schema.prisma](file:///d:/Product%20Development/NxtGen_Academy/server/prisma/schema.prisma)
No database schema changes are required since we can leverage the existing `SiteConfig` model to store `WHATSAPP_SYSTEM_PROMPT`.

