## Verification Plan

### Automated/Unit Testing
- Use postman or curl to test:
  - `GET /api/livekit/token?room=nxtgen-contact-room` -> Verify signed JWT is successfully minted.
  - `GET /api/whatsapp/webhook` -> Verify Meta verify token challenge checks.
  - `POST /api/whatsapp/webhook` -> Mock incoming payload, verify it invokes Gemini and returns `200 OK` (and triggers post to Meta API).

### Manual Verification
- Deploy changes to development dev server.
- Verify the stacked widgets render in the bottom-right corner across different pages (Home, Courses, etc.).
- Click the WhatsApp widget -> verify it redirects to `https://wa.me/919673000450`.
- Click the Voice Agent widget -> verify the sleek card slides up. Click "TALK TO PAVY" -> grant microphone access and verify LiveKit connection, voice streaming, and visualizer behavior.
- Edit `WHATSAPP_SYSTEM_PROMPT` in Admin -> verify settings successfully persist in the DB.
